Expected: **15 tests passing** ✅

## 📁 Key Files

- `src/ai/dynamic-flow/step-handlers.ts` - Step execution logic
- `src/ai/tool-registry.ts` - Tool registration
- `src/ai/flows/dynamic-flow-executor.ts` - Main orchestrator
