## 1. Pre-Deployment Checklist

### 1.1 Required Accounts & Services

✅ **Firebase Account**
- [ ] Firebase project created
- [ ] Billing enabled (Blaze plan)
- [ ] Firebase CLI installed: `npm install -g firebase-tools`
- [ ] Authenticated: `firebase login`

✅ **Google Cloud Platform**
- [ ] GCP project linked to Firebase
- [ ] APIs enabled:
  - Cloud Firestore API
  - Cloud Storage API
  - Cloud Functions API
  - Identity Platform API
  - Vertex AI API (for Gemini)

✅ **Qdrant Vector Database**
- [ ] Qdrant Cloud account OR self-hosted instance
- [ ] API key generated
- [ ] Collection created

✅ **Domain & SSL**
- [ ] Domain registered
- [ ] DNS configured
- [ ] SSL certificate (Firebase provides free SSL)

### 1.2 Code Preparation

✅ **Code Quality**
```bash
# Run all checks before deployment
npm run typecheck       # TypeScript validation
npm run lint           # ESLint checks
npm test              # Unit tests
npm run build         # Production build test
```

✅ **Environment Variables**
- [ ] All production secrets ready
- [ ] API keys secured
- [ ] Database credentials prepared

✅ **Dependencies**
